{"lines": ["Now go back two years, to the ninth of December, 1965.", "A brilliant fireball was seen in six American states, and over the Detroit and Windsor, Ontario area.", "Sky and Telescope magazine put the time near four forty-four in the afternoon, Eastern time. The Federal Aviation Administration received twenty-three reports from pilots, starting at that minute.", "A seismograph twenty-five miles southwest of Detroit recorded shock waves as the fireball passed through the atmosphere.", "Later, two astronomers used that seismograph record to pin the time to four forty-three. They used photographs of the trail, taken from two locations, to triangulate its path.", "That is what an exact time and direction gives you. A path that other people can check.", "In the village of Kecksburg, about thirty miles southeast of Pittsburgh, some people reported blue smoke, vibrations, and a thump. They said something had crashed in the woods.", "A feeling is easy to dismiss. A time and a direction are not."], "words": [["Now", 0.0, 0.22], ["go", 0.22, 0.46], ["back", 0.46, 0.72], ["two", 0.72, 1.02], ["years,", 1.02, 1.42], ["to", 1.42, 1.78], ["the", 1.78, 1.86], ["ninth", 1.86, 2.3], ["of", 2.3, 2.35], ["December,", 2.35, 2.82], ["1965.", 2.82, 4.06], ["A", 5.4, 5.52], ["brilliant", 5.52, 5.86], ["fireball", 5.86, 6.48], ["was", 6.48, 7.08], ["seen", 7.08, 7.38], ["in", 7.38, 7.64], ["six", 7.64, 7.92], ["American", 7.92, 8.4], ["states,", 8.4, 8.86], ["and", 8.86, 9.48], ["over", 9.48, 9.68], ["the", 9.68, 9.82], ["Detroit", 9.82, 10.22], ["and", 10.22, 10.58], ["Windsor,", 10.58, 11.08], ["Ontario", 11.08, 11.82], ["area.", 11.82, 12.48], ["Sky", 13.16, 13.62], ["and", 13.62, 14.02], ["Telescope", 14.02, 14.34], ["magazine", 14.34, 15.04], ["put", 15.04, 15.58], ["the", 15.58, 15.7], ["time", 15.7, 16.06], ["near", 16.06, 16.34], ["four", 16.34, 16.82], ["forty-four", 16.82, 17.3], ["in", 17.3, 17.84], ["the", 17.84, 17.94], ["afternoon,", 17.94, 18.52], ["Eastern", 19.18,